{
    "title": "Document Reader & Viewer",
    "description": "\ud83d\udcc2 Document Reader & Viewer is the most convenient all-in-one file viewer app to open and read all files in formats: PDF, DOCX, XLS, PPT, TXT... from internal storage, email, cloud, web and external storage.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcaf With this file reader app: You will view all types of Office files on your phone no need Internet, Wifi. Moreover you can quickly open all formats of files and read documents anytime, anywhere in a simple way and Free!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf All Document Reader app is very useful for people who want to read office files, edit and save documents without opening the computer. You'll see all your files organized in logical, easy-to-find folders. Open Word, read PDFs, manage all your files right on your phone quickly!\r\n\r\nMain features of Document Reader & Viewer app:\r\n\u2714\ufe0f All document manager & Office viewer \ud83d\udcda\r\n- Support all formats: PDF files, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Txt. \r\n- Document files are well organized in folders for quick searching and viewing.\r\n- Auto-scan all your PDF files, convert various types of documents to PDFs and extract texts from images accurately.\r\n- User friendly interface, easy to use.\r\n- Read all documents anywhere, anytime with just one click.\r\n- Small size app and lightweight, quick response.\r\n- Open and read document files with high quality, stable performance.\r\n- Many view modes: Horizontal / vertical scrolling mode / full screen, zoom in and out.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f PDF Reader - PDF Viewer \ud83d\udcd5\r\n- Open and read PDF files easier and faster like an e-book reader.\r\n- Search and jump to the page you want directly.\r\n- Supports ultra-fast reading PDF files: Documents, receipts, notes, photos, business cards, whiteboards...\r\n- Zoom in/zoom out pages while reading PDF files.\r\n- Share PDF files to your friends with a single tap.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f PDF Scanner - Convert photo to PDF \ud83d\udcc7\r\n- Use your phone\u2019s camera to quickly scan all types of documents into PDF files, such as receipts, notes, invoices, photos, business cards, certificates, and more.\r\n- Smart cropping and auto-enhancement features ensure the text and graphics in your scans are clear and sharp with premium colors and resolutions.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Word Reader and DOCX Viewer \ud83d\udcd8\r\n- A fast way of reading all Word documents: DOCX / DOCS / DOC files.\r\n- Create document, read, write and edit any writing text task of Word: Add, edit, delete, align text.\r\n- Find your target file easily through a quick search feature.\r\n- Review any document.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f Excel Reader - XLSX Viewer \ud83d\udcca\r\n- Quickly open all Excel spreadsheets: XLS, XLSX, CSV with high quality.\r\n- A powerful tool to manage Excel reports: View and edit metrics, data analysis, charts, budgets, task lists.\r\n- Rich Office features for accounting, finance and other fields.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0f PowerPoint Reader - PPT Viewer \ud83d\udcd9\r\n- Easily browse & open powerpoint and slides, presentations files.\r\n- Support reads all document files: PPT, PPTX, PPS, PPSX and slides presentations with high resolution.\r\n- Open, view, and search for different PPT books, college documents, and lecture slides.\r\n- Create new slides, draw shapes, insert pictures.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Document Reader & Viewer is an efficient office and productivity app for reading all documents files. This is definitely a great option for those who don\u2019t have time to sit in front of a computer to manage their files. You can read and manage documents in any format right on your phone on the go, saving you time.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49 Download Document Reader & Viewer now for FREE. This all-in-one file viewer is great for reading and processing document files like: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, Txt, etc. easily, anytime, anywhere.",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udcc2 Document Reader &amp; Viewer is the most convenient all-in-one file viewer app to open and read all files in formats: PDF, DOCX, XLS, PPT, TXT... from internal storage, email, cloud, web and external storage.<br><br>\ud83d\udcaf With this file reader app: You will view all types of Office files on your phone no need Internet, Wifi. Moreover you can quickly open all formats of files and read documents anytime, anywhere in a simple way and Free!<br><br>\ud83c\udfaf All Document Reader app is very useful for people who want to read office files, edit and save documents without opening the computer. You&#39;ll see all your files organized in logical, easy-to-find folders. Open Word, read PDFs, manage all your files right on your phone quickly!<br><br>Main features of Document Reader &amp; Viewer app:<br>\u2714\ufe0f All document manager &amp; Office viewer \ud83d\udcda<br>- Support all formats: PDF files, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, Txt. <br>- Document files are well organized in folders for quick searching and viewing.<br>- Auto-scan all your PDF files, convert various types of documents to PDFs and extract texts from images accurately.<br>- User friendly interface, easy to use.<br>- Read all documents anywhere, anytime with just one click.<br>- Small size app and lightweight, quick response.<br>- Open and read document files with high quality, stable performance.<br>- Many view modes: Horizontal / vertical scrolling mode / full screen, zoom in and out.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f PDF Reader - PDF Viewer \ud83d\udcd5<br>- Open and read PDF files easier and faster like an e-book reader.<br>- Search and jump to the page you want directly.<br>- Supports ultra-fast reading PDF files: Documents, receipts, notes, photos, business cards, whiteboards...<br>- Zoom in/zoom out pages while reading PDF files.<br>- Share PDF files to your friends with a single tap.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f PDF Scanner - Convert photo to PDF \ud83d\udcc7<br>- Use your phone\u2019s camera to quickly scan all types of documents into PDF files, such as receipts, notes, invoices, photos, business cards, certificates, and more.<br>- Smart cropping and auto-enhancement features ensure the text and graphics in your scans are clear and sharp with premium colors and resolutions.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f Word Reader and DOCX Viewer \ud83d\udcd8<br>- A fast way of reading all Word documents: DOCX / DOCS / DOC files.<br>- Create document, read, write and edit any writing text task of Word: Add, edit, delete, align text.<br>- Find your target file easily through a quick search feature.<br>- Review any document.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f Excel Reader - XLSX Viewer \ud83d\udcca<br>- Quickly open all Excel spreadsheets: XLS, XLSX, CSV with high quality.<br>- A powerful tool to manage Excel reports: View and edit metrics, data analysis, charts, budgets, task lists.<br>- Rich Office features for accounting, finance and other fields.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0f PowerPoint Reader - PPT Viewer \ud83d\udcd9<br>- Easily browse &amp; open powerpoint and slides, presentations files.<br>- Support reads all document files: PPT, PPTX, PPS, PPSX and slides presentations with high resolution.<br>- Open, view, and search for different PPT books, college documents, and lecture slides.<br>- Create new slides, draw shapes, insert pictures.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 Document Reader &amp; Viewer is an efficient office and productivity app for reading all documents files. This is definitely a great option for those who don\u2019t have time to sit in front of a computer to manage their files. You can read and manage documents in any format right on your phone on the go, saving you time.<br><br>\ud83d\udc49 Download Document Reader &amp; Viewer now for FREE. This all-in-one file viewer is great for reading and processing document files like: PDF, Word, Excel, PPT, Txt, etc. easily, anytime, anywhere.",
